<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: "20px 72px", background: "#F5E3BE", flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 122, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: "bold", color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'Songti SC', 'STSong', 'SimSun', serif" }}>一场能玩的对局，至少要同时成立这几件事</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 56, height: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 10 }} />
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.5, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.62)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginTop: 8 }}>对局闭环 = 落子可预期 + 操作可回退 + 状态可读 + 氛围可调</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ width: "100%", height: 510, flexDirection: "column" }}>
  <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", width: "100%", height: "100%", gap: 36, overflow: "hidden" }}>          <Box style={{ flexDirection: "column", gap: 10 }}>
      <Image src="assets/shot_connect6.png" style={{ width: 420, height: 200, objectFit: "cover", borderRadius: 8, border: "1px solid rgba(140,90,43,0.30)" }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: "#8C5A2B", fontWeight: "bold", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>实机 · 六子棋对局（侧栏含胜率曲线与主题）</Text>
    </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center" }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>点哪落哪的两步式交互、随时可退的悔棋、听得见的落子音、切得动的棋盘主题——缺任何一环，「能玩」都会打折扣。</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, lineHeight: 1.68, color: "#2A2118", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", marginBottom: 11 }}>右边这张对局界面元素并不密，但每一步操作都有明确反馈、每一步都可回退。这才是真正的「完整」——完整不等于按钮多，而是没有死路、没有不确定。</Text>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 11 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.82)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>落子：两步式（选格 → 确认），误触不落子。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 11 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.82)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>回退：悔棋一次撤一整轮，撤到我方落子之前。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 11 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.82)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>氛围：音乐、音效、主题三个系统各归各、可独立切换。</Text>
    </Box>
  </Box>
